    "description": "3 YouTube tricks that make watching way better 👇\n\n1️⃣ Double-tap to skip\nDouble-tap the right side of the video to skip ahead 10 seconds, or the left side to go back. Keep tapping to jump further.\n\n2️⃣ Hold for 2x speed\nPress and hold anywhere on the video to play it at 2x speed. Let go and it returns to normal. Great for slow intros.\n\n3️⃣ Set a sleep timer\nTap the video → Settings → Sleep timer and pick how long. The video pauses on its own, perfect for falling asleep to a video.\n\n💬 Which trick will you use first? Comment 1, 2 or 3!\n\n🔔 Subscribe for quick app tutorials every week.\n\n🌐 More tips and AI prompts: https://keepmesignedin.com\n\n#youtube #youtubetips #techtips #youtubetricks #phonehacks #shorts",
